27 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 25 0 R/Pg 4 0 R/K 0/Alt(One continuous shared shelter courtyard: Karuna offers Asha a steel cup while seated together on a bench. Prakash and Milan share a picture book behind them; Satya folds a blanket. An adult woman using a manual wheelchair practices slow breathing independently on the level courtyard floor. A rice and lentil plate with water stands near the bench. All people share one physical environment.)>>
